#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kalcul; is a math application for young children (starting age 6) testing "
"them on additions, substractions, multiplications and divisions. It also "
"provides mixed exercises. Two kinds of exercises can be done with &kalcul;: "
"tests on operations where you set the operation type and the range and then "
"the program asks random numbers questions and preset levels (you can use "
"provided tests or set your own levels via the <guimenu>Tools</guimenu> -&gt; "
"<guimenuitem>Level Editor</guimenuitem>)."
msgstr ""

