#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set the user name here in the User Name field. This name will be used to "
"save the results of all the tests for this user."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:252
#, no-c-format
msgid "You also set the number of questions per practice test here."
