#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you check Use a Timer, the test will be timed, i.e. it will stop after "
"the time is all finished. The timer will decrease."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
